---
import InfoLayout from '../layouts/InfoLayout.astro';
---
<InfoLayout
  path="/cookies"
  title="Cookie Policy"
  description="RateKit cookie policy. We only use essential analytics cookies. No advertising or tracking cookies."
  pageTag="Legal"
  h1="Cookie Policy"
  pageSub="What cookies RateKit uses, and what it doesn't."
  breadcrumbLabel="Cookies"
>
  <p class="last-updated">Last updated: April 28, 2026</p>

  <div class="highlight-box">
    <strong>Short version:</strong> We only use Google Analytics cookies to understand how visitors use our site. We do not use advertising, targeting, or social media tracking cookies.
  </div>

  <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites remember information about your visit.</p>

  <h2>Cookies We Use</h2>
  <table>
    <tr><th>Cookie</th><th>Provider</th><th>Purpose</th><th>Duration</th></tr>
    <tr><td>_ga</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Distinguishes unique users</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
    <tr><td>_ga_*</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Maintains session state</td><td>2 years</td></tr>
    <tr><td>_gid</td><td>Google Analytics</td><td>Distinguishes users (24h)</td><td>24 hours</td></tr>
  </table>

  <h2>Cookies We Do NOT Use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>❌ Advertising or retargeting cookies</li>
    <li>❌ Social media tracking cookies</li>
    <li>❌ Cross-site tracking cookies</li>
    <li>❌ Any cookies that identify you personally</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
  <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="https://support.google.com/chrome/answer/95647" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Chrome</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/cookies-information-websites-store-on-your-computer" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Firefox</a></li>
    <li><a href="https://support.apple.com/guide/safari/manage-cookies-sfri11471/mac" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Safari</a></li>
  </ul>
  <p>You can also opt out of Google Analytics tracking by installing the <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Google Analytics Opt-out Browser Add-on</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about our cookie use? Email <a href="mailto:connect4fund@gmail.com">connect4fund@gmail.com</a></p>
</InfoLayout>
